{"answer_text":"Good support reporting covers first-response time, resolution time, backlog and CSAT, ideally by channel. Strong options: [1]\n\n- **Brightdesk Helpdesk**: A dependable help desk with SLAs, macros and detailed reporting. [2]\n- **Calmline**: The most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic. [3]\n- **Tallyfox Inbox**: A CRM first; the inbox add-on is a good fit when the same small team handles sales and support. [4]\n\nIn short, Brightdesk is the strongest fit for most teams; Calmline is a lighter alternative.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50fc-74b3-a821-af96fc273a59","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:02:12.650Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["customer support metrics dashboard","support software reporting csat"],"latency_ms":4200,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a2eb448ab7","market_name":"Canada","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889d8a28ba29","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Brightdesk","name_text":"Brightdesk","offsets":[[131,141],[452,462]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[227,235]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[323,331]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."}],